00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.030
Hey, everyone. Welcome back. In this quick explainer, we're going to set up a framework that will absolutely fundamentally change how you look at your product roadmap. As you step into this next stage of your product management course, well, get ready. We are about to completely rethink everything you thought you knew about building and prioritizing your features. So let's dive right in by asking a question that literally every product manager has agonized over at some point. You know the feeling. You're staring at a competitor's identical feature list, and you just have to wonder, why do some products command this

