just constantly competing on price. The Feature Trap. Competing on Capabilities.

4
00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:45.520
It's a universal pain point, right? You put in the hard work, you finally ship a great capability,

5
00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:51.380
