33
00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:24.230
And listen, this isn't just some fluffy marketing concept. Having a clear core belief makes

34
00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:28.570
prioritizing your daily headaches lightning fast, and best of all, totally objective.

35
00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:33.390
The Celery Test filters your backlog prioritization, keeping out those shiny but

36
